<title>UK: LIFFE coffee, cocoa end off highs, sugar down.</title>
<headline>LIFFE coffee, cocoa end off highs, sugar down.</headline>
<text>
<p>COFFEE - Ends up but well off highs after late NY inspired jump. Active May up $17 at $1,545.</p>
<p>COCOA - Also ends off highs after afternoon spike up. Ivory arrival news noted. May up seven at 874 stg.</p>
<p>SUGAR - Still lower but most contracts off day's  lows. May down $2.0 at $306.10 at 1705 GMT.</p>
</text>
